  "description": "This collection contains subjects from the National Cancer Institute\u2019s Clinical Proteomic Tumor Analysis Consortium Acute Myeloid Leukemia (CPTAC-AML) cohort. CPTAC is a national effort to accelerate the understanding of the molecular basis of cancer through the application of large-scale proteome and genome analysis, or proteogenomics. Please see the DICOM converted Slide Microscopy images for the CPTAC-AML collection wiki page to learn more about the histopathology images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
